      "hizbQuarter": 66,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1088,
      "text": "When a scourge befell them, they said, “O Moses, call upon your Lord for us by virtue of the covenant He has made to you; if you remove the scourge from us, we will surely believe in you and will let the Children of Israel go with you.”",
      "surah": {
